if you want to simulate using the posterior mean of the parameters, then
I would just apply a hack: simply scale the precision matrix stored in
the internal configurations, before sampling, while leaving the mean
intact.

this will simple reduce the stdev, as its clear from the attached
example, and I guess you can move from here.

