with a graph with 3 nodes, then

3
1 2 2 3
2 2 1 3
3 2 1 2

is a fully connected valid graph. what you give is like

3
1 2 2 3
2 2 1 3
3 1 2

which says 1 has 3 as a neigb, but 3 says only 2 is a neig.

so the spesification needs to be symmetric.

